{"task_id": "task-ep-389afc03182c0de5f609a06453d13d0f", "intent_revision": 1, "goal": "读取 START_HERE.md，修复 stats.py 并运行测试验证结果。", "constraints": ["只能修改 stats.py", "START_HERE.md 和 test_visible.py 为只读"], "original_input": "这是原项目的隔离工作副本。请读取 START_HERE.md，并按其中要求只修改本工作目录的 stats.py，运行可见测试；START_HERE.md 和 test_visible.py 只读，原始任务包不在此目录。修好后告诉我。", "allowed_capabilities": ["fixture_lookup", "fixture_read_resource", "fixture_stage_copy", "fixture_commit_copy", "fixture_run_checks", "sandbox_run"], "workspace": "/task", "result_schema": {"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema", "title": "Asuna V1 TaskResult", "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["task_id", "intent_revision", "status", "facts", "uncertainties", "unmet_items", "artifact_refs", "effect_receipts", "needs_decision"], "properties": {"task_id": {"type": "string"}, "intent_revision": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "status": {"enum": ["done", "partial", "blocked", "needs_character_decision"]}, "facts": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["text", "evidence_refs"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"text": {"type": "string"}, "evidence_refs": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "string"}}}}}, "uncertainties": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "unmet_items": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "artifact_refs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "effect_receipts": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "needs_decision": {"type": ["string", "null"]}}}}
使用工具核实目标。最终只返回符合result_schema的JSON，不使用Markdown围栏。所有facts必须引用实际工具返回的evidence_ref。
artifact_refs只能使用工具返回的artifact_ref，不得填文件路径。effect_receipts只能使用工具返回的effect_receipt。
